  "description": "One moment, critic Hee-Su is posting hateful comments about top actor Do-Hyun. The next? She's waking up naked in his bed! As if fated by a cruel joke, Hee-Su is forced to co-star with Do-Hyun in a new reality show called, \"Going To Bed With Your Hater.\" With the cameras rolling, Do-Hyun's aggressive advances feel all too real, and Hee-Su's pure hatred begins to melt into a dangerously sizzling passion. Can she resist the enemy she's accidentally falling in love with?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
